    "ephemeralProfileAndStrategy": "supported",
    "journalContractAndPureReplay": "supported",
    "liveSettingsReconfiguration": "capability-detected-optional",
    "durableMutation": "unavailable-fail-closed",
    "reason": "DSH 0.1.2-alpha.1 still provides no atomic run coordination Host service for durable mutation, and its persisted-event vocabulary has no registration seam for out-of-repository legion/* events. Journal activation therefore remains fail-closed. Ephemeral Specialists and Strategies remain supported; full Run Receipt facts use the optional process-local companion feed, append no custom Session event, and keep the bounded tool summary when the companion is absent."
